{"content":[{"c":["DAY’S JOURNEY"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Way of estimating distances in Bible times. A day’s journey approximated 20 miles (32.2 kilometers) but depended on such things as mode of travel, the terrain, and the weather. Scripture refers both to a day’s journey (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.3.18","r":"Exod.3.18","rawR":"Exod.3.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.3.18","value":"Exod.3.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 3:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.11.31","r":"Num.11.31","rawR":"Num.11.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.11.31","value":"Num.11.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 11:31"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.19.4","r":"1Kgs.19.4","rawR":"1Kgs.19.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.19.4","value":"1Kgs.19.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 19:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.2.44","r":"Luke.2.44","rawR":"Luke.2.44","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.2.44","value":"Luke.2.44"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 2:44"},") and to a Sabbath day’s journey (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.1.12","r":"Acts.1.12","rawR":"Acts.1.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.1.12","value":"Acts.1.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 1:12"},"). A Sabbath day’s journey was probably about 3,500 feet (one kilometer). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=SabbathDaysJourney_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"SabbathDaysJourney_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"SabbathDaysJourney_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Sabbath Day’s Journey"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"DaysJourney","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 3:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.3.18","rawQueryValue":"Exod.3.18","sourceRefExact":"Exod.3.18"},{"anchorText":"Nm 11:31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.11.31","rawQueryValue":"Num.11.31","sourceRefExact":"Num.11.31"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 19:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.19.4","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.19.4","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.19.4"},{"anchorText":"Lk 2:44","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.2.44","rawQueryValue":"Luke.2.44","sourceRefExact":"Luke.2.44"},{"anchorText":"Acts 1:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.1.12","rawQueryValue":"Acts.1.12","sourceRefExact":"Acts.1.12"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"06c197f95cdb21daac22c1876413a7d74d60d13bca81d7fea316fa1c344048c0","sourceItemName":"DaysJourney","sourceItemOrder":43,"sourceMember":"Articles/D.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"DaysJourney","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Day’s Journey","title":"Day’s Journey","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}